Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们该做点事儿了啊  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels got to have something to do, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在可是后天启时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we're post-apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔和他的追随者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael and his followers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要他掌管天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}they want him to rule heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  和大多数其他天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- and many others --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最怕的就是让他接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing we want is to let him take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说内战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷了摩西之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole the staff of moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我偷的东西多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我需要武器  -这个不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need the weapons. - Don't ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能打败拉斐尔  就可以结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can beat Raphael, we can end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell, uh, Raphael...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死远点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到下次和他见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:41.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和人通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to make a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以用我的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a cell you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那种通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that kind of call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴再见到你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you again, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个恶魔  萨姆  没啥好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a demon, Sam, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想杀了我们  我们也想杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us dead. We want them dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:01:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看她对你做了什么  她是毒药  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what she did to you! She's poison, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在城里  补充补给呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In town, supply run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这鬼天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.59,0:01:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他是纯爷们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man's a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.69,0:01:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西也确实都用光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were officially out of hunter's helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看过"教父"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen "The Godfather," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.05,0:01:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在结尾  迈克尔·科里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the end, where Michael Corleone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派他的手下去解决掉他的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}sends his men to kill his enemies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干净利落一举全灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}in one big, bloody swoop?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死海盐  不错  不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dead sea brine." Good, good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  莫·格林眼睛中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Moe Greene gets it in the eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.53,0:01:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后唐·库在旋转门中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Don Cuneo gets it in the revolving door?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "Hey."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:01:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羊羔的血  羊羔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood of lamb. Blood of lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啤酒  凉披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer, cold pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羊羔的血  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}blood of lamb. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羊羔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood of lamb!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你扯什么教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you talking about "The Godfather"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们简直是身临其境  现在  就今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're in it -- right now, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而扮演迈克尔·科里昂的正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the role of Michael Corleone --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangel Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我们解释一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind telling us what you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣徒之骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bone of a lesser saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段椎骨非常合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}This vertebra will do very nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.83,0:02:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们辛格先生有用的东西真不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Mr. Singer does keep a beautiful pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  拉斐尔在追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Raphael is after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔在追杀我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael is after us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他加强了自己的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he's consolidated his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已经开始行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小卡呢  -小卡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And where's cass? - Oh, Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他深处地下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is deep, deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的老好人斐斐出了张猎杀名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, good old Raffy put out a hit list
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,囊括了所有帮助过我们萌卡的好人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}on every last samaritan who helped our dear Cass --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.98,0:03:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是  还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so much more importantly, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想把小卡引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he wants to draw Cass out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:09.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们会信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you expect us to just believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:10.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那别信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:11.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我把你们扔哪你们就得去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll go where I throw you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了  先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all the time we have, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超炫的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Garish, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.36,0:03:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你斐叔派了他最恶毒的手下来对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, uncle Raffy sent one of his nastiest to handle me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我其中一个肺也挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And down a lung at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没啥关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我拿这玩意干嘛  -带着跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I supposed to do with this? - Run with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgil!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了  跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,落地相当不错  干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real good solid fall. Way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德  詹森  太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared, jensen! Outstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凶鬼恶灵  第1场重复  第1次拍摄\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural," Scene one echo, take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打板  标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tail slate. Marker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...No angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概  没天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No angels, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那很棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是特技的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a problem with the stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  信号的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a problem with the...signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是不是要杀掉什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we be killing anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想不用  -我们能用多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. - Well, how much did we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-跑吗  -大概一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Running? - About half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-往哪跑  -我们倒退到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Gets us right up to where they --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒退到他们撞上窗户之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before they hit the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们撞上窗户的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the part where they hit the window
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是段好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the good part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以清理下  重置窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can clean up, reset the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上  需要95分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}takes about 95 minutes, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们需要洗掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we'd have to blow off the scene
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们坐在黑斑羚上谈心的那场戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they sit on the impala and talk about their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你来回吐槽信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You answer the hate mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们可以让他们飞向窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could have them fly at the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}then freeze frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切黑屏  继续演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then cut to black, act out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serviceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.44,0:05:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第六季\N{\fnArial\fs30}Season six.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.34,0:05:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德和詹森收工\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a wrap on Jared and Jensen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-who the hell are --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德  三分钟  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared! Three minutes, okay? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.80,0:05:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹森  你在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jensen, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐到椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get you in the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Chair"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们来把妆卸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna get this makeup off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没化什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not wearing any ma--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个花哨的娘炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a painted whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是崔西·伊云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trish Evian here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是凶鬼恶灵中的杰瑞德·帕德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Jared Padalecki from tv's "Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德  第六季\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Jared, season six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打败了路西法  丢了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beat the devil, lost your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后又找了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got it back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  接下来萨姆·温彻斯特会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell us, what's next for Sam Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I-I-I really don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答的时候重复一下问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and if you could include the question in your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  他们给咱们化妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, they put freakin' makeup on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那群混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想我知道怎么回事了  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I think I know what this is. - Okay. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是部电视剧  -还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a tv show. - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  这里  不管这里是哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, here -- wherever "Here" is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽把我们塞进的这个灵异界\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- this twilight zone Balthazar zapped us into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎的  我们的生活是部电视剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever reason, our life is a tv show.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  怎么会有人喜欢看咱们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously. Why? Why would anybody want to watch our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据刚采访我的那个人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, according to that interviewer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收视率挺低的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not very many people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没说这事很合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.54,0:07:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说  我们掉到了某个次元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, we -- we landed in some dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里你是詹森·阿克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you're Jensen Aackles,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是什么杰瑞德·帕德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm something called a "Jared Padalecki."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你成波兰人了是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, now you're Polish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整件事都是扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is any of this making any sense to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我的宝贝也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least my baby made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:32.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方简直让我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like this whole place is bad-touching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.01,0:07:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得该怎么做  找小卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think? Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找他最靠谱  如果他还活着的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our best shot, if he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你正忙着逃出天堂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are... maybe running his ass away from heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你能听到我们的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}we pray that you have your ears on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫  呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaker breaker...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  是小卡  嘿  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Cass! Hey, Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽对我们做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-w-what did Balthazar do to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了让你俩不被维吉尔抓到\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep you out of Virgil's reach,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把你们送到了另一个现实里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's cast you into an alternate reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个和我们世界极其类似\N{\fnArial\fs30}a universe similar to ours in most respects
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但某些方面又完全迥异的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet dramatically different in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像  就像比扎罗星球(DC漫画创造出的星球)那种  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like -- like Bizarro earth, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过这儿没有比扎罗超人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Except instead of having Bizarro superman, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的却是一群蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get this clown factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正  现在没时间解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyway, no time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是不是有钥匙  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have the key? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这玩意儿是干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what does this thing do, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.23,0:08:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一个房间的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It opens a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房间里都有些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽从天堂偷出来的所有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every weapon Balthazar stole from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就这么拱手给我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保证钥匙安全  在我找到你们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep it safe until I could reach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了那些武器  我就有机会恢复力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}With those weapons, I have a chance to rally my forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白  真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Okay, good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这个电视剧啥的又是咋回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now, uh, what's the deal with all this tv crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问的好  帕德蕾丝克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Amen, Padaleski.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是"里克"  -啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh"Lecki.  - "What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很确定是帕德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lecki. Pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-难道又有新台词啊  -新的啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they put out new pages? - New what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在开什么国际玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is this some kind of cosmic joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是的话  那就太冷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause if it is, it's stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们也没找到笑点  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we don't get it. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那些全都是台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are words in a script.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.37,0:09:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他根本不是小卡  -老哥  瞧瞧他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't Cass. - Dude, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.18,0:09:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩是想对台词  还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys want to run lines, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子叫米沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misha?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是  太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米沙  詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misha? Jensen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是些啥鬼名字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with the names around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是唬住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really punked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要把这发到推特上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm totally gonna tweet this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好啊  米饭们 \N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hola, Mishamigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,J2骗得我好惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}"J-squared...got me good."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真想把手伸进脑子里狂抓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to dig my finger in my brain and scratch 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们回到堪萨斯州\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we're back in Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"真的开始觉得和其他人一样了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Really... starting to feel... like one of the guys."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,J·阿克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"J. Ackles."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那是假的我  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's fake me! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定是我的假房车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be fake mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  我有一架直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I have a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  谁会放这么大的鱼缸在自己拖车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who puts a 300-gallon aquarium in their trailer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然就是詹森·阿克斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, Jensen Ackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们来瞧瞧这家伙究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go. Let's see who this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他不是猎魔人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's not a hunter, 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他扮演的角色是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he plays one on tv.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这俩贱人  还一副模特范儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these male-modelin' sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小表情做的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice "Blue Steel," Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很显然  那是我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Apparently, it's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, uh, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网上说你来自德克萨斯州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...It says you're from Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说你演过一出肥皂剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says you were on a soap opera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:20.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没有得癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't have cancer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.42,0:11:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没有结婚  而且我还很有钱的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wasn't married, and I had plenty of money...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意跟我私奔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you -- would you want to run away with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我真在乎钱吗  妮可\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I really care about money, Nicole?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在乎的是你的健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care that you're healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那种半途而废的人 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm no quitter, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我十分讨厌这里  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't like this universe, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须离开这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  双手赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No argument here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我觉得小卡没有收到我们的呼叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think our -- our prayers are reaching Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确切地说是真正的小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the real Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝对已经不在灵魂呼叫服务区了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we are definitely out of, uh, soul-phone range.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能颠倒巴尔萨泽的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can reverse Balthazar's spell... 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我留意了每一个步骤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要找齐所有材料  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We just, uh, get the ingredients, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再回到同一扇窗户前  然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}get back to that same window, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿都不如自己的家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}...There's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣徒的脊椎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backbone of a lesser Saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是橡胶制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧这个  是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look. It's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他俩开始说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least they're talking to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些垃圾对我们有屁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do with this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的一切当然都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course everything is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是在片场啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a film set.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回到真实世界去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你说到点上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, now you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找点儿真家伙  \N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we go round up the genuine articles, 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再带回来继续那个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring 'em here for the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙出什么毛病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿克斯先生  阿克斯先生  拜托  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Ackles! Mr. Ackles, please! - Uh, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊  阿克斯先生  求您停停\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, Mr. Ackles, please  stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.45,0:13:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  它不是你的爱车  -请停停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, it's not the Impala. - Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还用说么  -求您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个该死的道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a frigging prop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和那些假东西一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  真是太感谢你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you so much for...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底该怎么离开这该死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩想让我带你们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know whereabouts you want me to drop you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jensen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我  对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是跟着...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I'll just tag along with, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-杰瑞德  -杰瑞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jared. - Jared. ...Jared here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩什么时候开始说话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Since when are you guys talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你也知道的  克林特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, y-you know what, Clint, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是克利夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, Clif.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊  对对  当然啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-yeah. Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克利夫  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clif. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要回我家  然后做点...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so, uh, I think we're gonna go back to my place a-and do some...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,演戏的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work on our acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没错  -为了我们的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - For our characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为这个剧  -对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For the show. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来  我们这是在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到  温哥华)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.91,0:14:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  我们都没在美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, we're not even in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是低调的华丽啊  Jay-Z(美国嘻哈歌手)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice modest digs, Jay-z.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定算得上是个中翘楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be the star of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个啥  德古拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I, Dracula?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔治·汉密尔顿版德古拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}George Hamilton Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才对嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:15:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  你后院里有头骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you have a camel in your backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是羊驼  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an Alpaca, dumbass.
