Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ruby." Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还来这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one never gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的工作如何啊  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was work today, hon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.03,0:15:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
