Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉着这有意思吗  詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you honestly think that's funny, Jensen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你其实不是露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. 'cause you're not Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可能是她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how could you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:52.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然就是  饰演露比的美女演员啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course! You are the lovely actress who plays Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are, uh, in...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, because you two are
