Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.78,0:16:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你娶了假露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You married fake Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩这是做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想顺道过来  问个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just, uh, thought I'd pop in, say "Hey."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  对对台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, and -- and -- and maybe run some lines. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从来就没来过我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never even been to our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天看见你家后院有只羊驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that I know there's an alpaca out back,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下次一定还来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm definitely coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.84,0:16:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羊驼是最环保的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, alpacas are the greenest animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,环保非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去办事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's that thing I have to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊对了  你有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Of course, yeah. The thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国际海獭领养慈善晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The International Otter Adoption Charity Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们终于和好了  我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad you two are talking, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你过得挺滋润啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like you did all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.13,0:17:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该去查查她叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should figure out her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"圣徒腕骨与圣物箱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wrist bone of saint and holy reliquary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"博物馆品质  出自瓦哈卡教区"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Museum-quality, from diocese in Oaxaca."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看起来是真品  -成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks legit. - All right.
