Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  老弟  那东西十多万\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Dude, that thing's over a hundred thou--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  杰瑞德·帕德里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jared Padalecki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在海关见你朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cubrir a su amigo en la aduana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.84,0:17:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.23,0:17:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加急快递  莫有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple rush. No problemo.
