Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个什么海赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的事怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}otter thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody missed you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要问你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So -- so listen, I-I got to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember, uh, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前年  那些自然灾害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Year before last, all those disasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-自然灾害  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Disasters? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地震频发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, the whole earthquake spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗马9.2级地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the -- the 9.2 in Rome?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波士顿郊区8.5级\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the -- the 8.5 outside Boston?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西岸海啸连锁反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole east/west tsunami chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.59,0:19:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全都记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember all of those
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是上一季剧情\N{\fnArial\fs30}from last season on your show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  是  对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的就是这个  就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That -- that's what I mean. That's what I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.76,0:19:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是萨姆·温彻斯特演太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been Sam Winchester way too long.
