Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们为什么要早上8点跑到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are we picking up packages at 8:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取一包还没办理报关手续的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that haven't cleared customs yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了省时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saving time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  可算到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做的事违法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing anything illegal, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们否认你会感觉好点不  -不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would it make you feel better if we said no? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就是累死也要12小时内拍完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We finish today in 12 hours if it kills us all.
