Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要清场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we're gonna need the, uh, set cleared
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保险起见  1小时左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}For -- safe side, an hour or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.43,0:20:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要清场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need it cleared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me and, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰瑞德有些演员的事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared we're gonna do some actor stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jensen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为你俩新颖的合作感到很欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're thrilled to see you collaborating so creatively.
