Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.69,0:21:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽才不是什么英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar is no hero.
