Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩冷冷地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, grimly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.11,0:22:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你却对此毫不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, somehow you got no problem with it.
