Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.13,0:22:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.29,0:22:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.67,0:23:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.59,0:23:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看哪儿都行  别看镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look anywhere but the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because we have no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.99,0:23:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a key,
