Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.15,0:23:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开拍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a key...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一定有把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}then there has to be a lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到那把锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we find the lock,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.18,0:23:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以得到武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can get the weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就可以得到那些武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we can have the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有锁  锁还在我们手里是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the lock. We'll still have the lock, I imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为是我们开的锁  还有之前那把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we've opened it, and, of course, the initial key.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.73,0:23:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把这三样鬼玩意儿都找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get all three of that crap.
