Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.35,0:23:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说话就是这个调\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he talks. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说这台词真的有必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we really need all these lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:23:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不都演明白了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I-I-I think we've covered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是不是  -停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神马状况啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.37,0:24:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨不忍睹的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}An atrocity is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.01,0:24:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他们不能演下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like they should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能停\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.69,0:24:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不准停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拍下的镜头有能用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get anything we can use?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.97,0:24:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格地说  我们拍下的都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, technically, we have them saying everything
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.56,0:24:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说的七零八碎的台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}in bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算是某种尝试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be sort of experimental?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.07,0:24:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第六季\N{\fnArial\fs30}Season six.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.67,0:24:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wrote this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.77,0:24:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会说"倒数第二"啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody says "Penultimate!"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来把枪  放我嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun, mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.21,0:24:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"依我拙见"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I-m-h-o,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"J2昨晚肯定熬夜了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}'J' and 'J' had a late one last night."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:50.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赚了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We earned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.90,0:24:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"咩哈哈笑使我了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"R-o-t-f-l-m-a-o."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.55,0:24:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你给我讲清楚 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell it out for me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.89,0:25:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是什么级别的警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is our terror-alert level here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.59,0:25:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  瑟拉  橙色级别的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Sera. Orange, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.35,0:25:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们开始互相交谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started talking to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.93,0:25:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不过那是件好事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! But that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.64,0:25:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在詹森住在杰瑞德的家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now Jensen's living at Jared's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就这样  -还有  克利夫说他们从墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - Plus, Clif says they're smuggling
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.72,0:25:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走私非法物品  -就这样 娘炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- illegal stuff in from Mexico. - That's it, toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.61,0:25:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米沙在推特上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misha's celebrity tweet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是黑市倒卖器官什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}says it's a black-market organ thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.89,0:25:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌是毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm betting drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正就我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, as far as I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.89,0:25:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经失去了所有天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they've lost any shred of talent they ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.93,0:25:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能我们搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we did it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.45,0:25:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个咒语非常正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that -- that spell was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.81,0:25:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should have worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能起作用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.59,0:25:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一宿没睡  在网上查资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was up all night, looking online.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sign
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.86,0:25:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启一类的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anything like the apocalypse happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.06,0:25:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从未有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.12,0:25:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as far as I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.65,0:25:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物  鬼魂  恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters, ghosts, demons --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.58,0:25:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就是没人猎魔咯  -没有猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So nobody's hunting them? - No hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.51,0:26:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们的咒语才没有效果  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe that's why our spell didn't work, Dean, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能这里根本没有超自然力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-maybe here, there's no supernatural,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.95,0:26:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}no magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.99,0:26:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有恶魔  没有地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No demons, no hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有天堂  没有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}no heaven, no -- no God?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.15,0:26:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更好的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.05,0:26:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}no angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.21,0:26:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  可能我们现在无法离开...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe we can't get out of, uh, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个"翻版地球"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}earth number two right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.91,0:26:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们起码\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the least we can do
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能离开加拿大这个鬼地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}is get the hell out of the Canadian part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.11,0:26:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再听到冰球  我就要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear one more conversation about hockey, I'm gonna puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.48,0:26:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边  这边  这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, this way, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  应该是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. It's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:27:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩  我真的认为  我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, look, I really -- I really think that we should --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.60,0:27:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为你跑得掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can run?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.18,0:27:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法力无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mojo-free zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.19,0:27:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里用不了法术\N{\fnArial\fs30}No magic in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.93,0:27:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就是个普通的混蛋而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes you nothing but a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我负责监督所有特技表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I oversee all the stunts,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.42,0:27:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还指导打斗戏份\N{\fnArial\fs30}coordinate all the fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太刺激了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.90,0:27:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是你指导的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that one of yours, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.95,0:27:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.56,0:27:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好  不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good! Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.18,0:27:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手  你们没搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.34,0:27:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了   维吉尔   维吉尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, Virgil! Virgil!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.69,0:27:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你的脖子扭断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna break your friggin' neck! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.88,0:27:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我只是想弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to understand, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:28:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑟拉  我们自己也搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, Sera, we don't really understand it ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.58,0:28:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  看上去好像杰瑞德和詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, it appears that Jared and Jensen
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.22,0:28:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想把一个临时演员给揍死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}were seen beating an extra to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.01,0:28:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是吉姆  瑟拉  不是揍死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jim here, Sera, and it wasn't all the way to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.48,0:28:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人只是受了伤  顺便说下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only partway, so that's a plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.15,0:28:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人还能跑路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could definitely still run.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会跟进这件事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll certainly follow up on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.08,0:28:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我觉得真正的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think the real issue here, Sera,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.88,0:28:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这俩孩子好像长期\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that the boys appear to be
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都迷迷糊糊的  跟嗑药了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}on some kind of extended psychedelic acid trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.62,0:28:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, o-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我飞过去和他们谈谈  可能会有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it'd help if I -- I'll fly up and talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.94,0:28:31.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太确定杰瑞德和詹森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm not sure Jared and Jensen...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.21,0:28:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道她是谁  严格来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}know who she is, strictly speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还是一个新人  无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, you know, new. No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉着吧  眼下最需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think what we might need at this stage
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.27,0:28:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是能让克里普克亲自来一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}is for Kripke to come up himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.09,0:28:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这剧是他创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He created the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.11,0:28:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会听他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.10,0:28:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我情何以堪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that make me look?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.48,0:28:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这剧是我负责的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be running this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.51,0:28:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且埃里克正宅在某地的小屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, Eric is off in some cabin somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,筹写他的新剧呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}writing his next pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.27,0:28:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他卖了Octocobra  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He sold "Octocobra"? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:29:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,额滴那个神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.39,0:29:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么都买\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不懂了  维吉尔跑出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I mean, Virgil broke through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.01,0:29:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能他知道回去的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's got a way to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.48,0:29:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者他在这里用不了法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he has no juice here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.67,0:29:08.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他和我们一样被困住了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he's stuck, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.12,0:29:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  我还没揍完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, either way, I want to finish kicking his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安米沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Misha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.34,0:29:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安  小盆友\N{\fnArial\fs30}'night, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"你们是否有过这种感觉"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ever get that feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"觉得有人潜藏在你的后座"\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone's in the backseat?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.12,0:29:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"T_T"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frowny face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.54,0:29:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逮到你们了  有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, guys! You got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.20,0:29:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我们在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we're -- we're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.26,0:29:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想杀死的那个临时演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh -- for that extra you tried to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.47,0:29:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is it money?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.49,0:30:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们再给你们加点钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the kind of act that goes away
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.07,0:30:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就能消停了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can scare up some coverage on a raise?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.74,0:30:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加薪\N{\fnArial\fs30}More money?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.16,0:30:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你付给这俩家伙的钱已经够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already pay these two jokers enough as it is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.67,0:30:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我觉得吧  过了这么些年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'd like to think that over these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.20,0:30:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们日益亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've grown closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.98,0:30:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不当我是鲍比导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you don't think of me as "Director bob"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.99,0:30:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是监制人鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}or "Executive producer Bob Singer,"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.41,0:30:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是鲍比叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as "Uncle Bob."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.75,0:30:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这剧里的角色  鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the character in the show, Bobby Singer --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.70,0:30:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个猪头会给角色取个和自己一样的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of douchebag names a character after himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.05,0:30:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.58,0:30:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, let's begin again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.79,0:30:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.42,0:30:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得维吉尔没拿到那把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't think Virgil would have shagged out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不会离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}without getting his mitts on that key. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.89,0:30:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.38,0:30:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能嗑完药来工作啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't come to work on poppers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.85,0:30:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还从墨西哥走私肾脏入国\N{\fnArial\fs30}and smuggle kidneys in from Mexico
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.65,0:30:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还随便乱改台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make up your own lines as you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能随便乱改台词\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot make up your own lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.41,0:30:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊  你们的演艺事业怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god, what about your careers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去他娘的演艺事业  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Screw our careers, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.54,0:30:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.81,0:30:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到我弟弟的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.45,0:31:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我说的是"弟弟"\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I said "brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.28,0:31:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你知道么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you know what, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.42,0:31:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是温家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.07,0:31:10.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前是  现在是  以后也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always have been, and always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.46,0:31:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的世界里  没人知道我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where we're from, people don't know who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.66,0:31:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.11,0:31:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那个世界  我们至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We mattered in that world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.13,0:31:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我们还偶尔救救人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we even saved a son of a bitch once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  好吧  这里也许有一些粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yeah, okay, here, maybe there's some -- some fans
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.14,0:31:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很在乎这些个垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}who give a crap about this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.36,0:31:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会称之为垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't call it nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Bob Singer --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that even is your name --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me this --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what does it all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.26,0:31:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.85,0:31:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们都有神经质的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've all had our psychotic breaks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.91,0:31:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can work with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.36,0:31:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.66,0:31:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维吉尔  他把钥匙拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgil -- I think he has the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们辞演\N{\fnArial\fs30}We quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.18,0:31:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  好的  别动气  别动气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay. Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.41,0:32:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活在这种鸟不拉屎又脏又破的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live in this grubby, shabby desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.87,0:32:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里跟你们一样  一无是处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing greater than yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.74,0:32:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死后不过是一小撮尘土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but dirt when you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.76,0:32:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有超能力  没有魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No power, no magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.10,0:32:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本  我根本不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so-- I'm not following you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.05,0:32:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里什么魔法都不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no magic in your universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.05,0:32:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.75,0:32:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只有一袋绳子和滑轮  -你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing but a bag of strings and pulleys. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.71,0:32:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该感激接下来我对你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should thank me for what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.76,0:32:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  你究竟要对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What are you about to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.29,0:32:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要做一个很重要的召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to make an important call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.65,0:32:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向上帝祈求能够成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray to god that it even goes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也沦落到如此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I've been reduced to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.90,0:32:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以黑入警察的调度系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we get inside the police dispatch system.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.97,0:33:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给维吉尔弄一张全国通缉令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put out an A.P.B. On Virgil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有用  如果他还这样招摇过市的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might work, if he stays obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.54,0:33:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.27,0:33:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.51,0:33:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.88,0:33:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米沙  他被人刺死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Misha! He's been stabbed to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪里  -在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.99,0:33:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有良心没啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.44,0:33:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告  禁止入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caution do not enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.79,0:33:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是拉斐尔  跟忍者神龟一名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, Raphael. Like the ninja turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.04,0:33:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当时在召唤一个来自天堂的  名叫拉斐尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was calling someone name of Raphael, up in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.82,0:33:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  没错  就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.74,0:33:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个可怕的男人杀了这个大哭大叫的帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The -- the scary man killed the attractive crying man,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.63,0:33:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他就开始祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he started to pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.79,0:33:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the strange part --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.35,0:33:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过了不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}after a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.72,0:33:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓听到有个声音回应他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I s-swear I heard this voice, answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.04,0:33:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听上去就是一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it didn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.58,0:34:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.27,0:34:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个声音说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The voice said,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.58,0:34:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"明天维吉尔即将回去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For Virgil to return tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.37,0:34:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"从来时的那个地方”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"at the place where he crossed over,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.07,0:34:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"和来时的那个时间"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"at the time of the crossing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.62,0:34:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"拉斐尔将会透过那个窗户”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And Raphael would reach through the window
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.62,0:34:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"并带他和那把钥匙回去"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take him and the key home."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.66,0:34:21.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.13,0:34:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.76,0:34:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  如果维吉尔带着那把钥匙回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if Virgil gets back with that key,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.80,0:34:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡就死定了  我们的世界也完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is dead, and our world is toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.66,0:34:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个没了翅膀的天使还能有多厉害呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how bad can an angel with no wings be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.55,0:34:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看那支半压动式步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see that pump-action tactical,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口径12毫米\N{\fnArial\fs30}12-gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.80,0:34:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.56,0:34:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼光不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:35:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  你对军械真是了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really know your ordnance, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.33,0:35:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是天堂的武器管理者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the weapons keeper of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.09,0:35:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.57,0:35:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.30,0:35:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们阻止了维吉尔  拿到钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that if we drop Virgil, get the key,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.71,0:35:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也许就得长住在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then this might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.65,0:35:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很可能就困死在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might be stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.46,0:35:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们会找到回去的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we'll figure out a way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.28,0:35:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  尽管回不去对你也没坏处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you wouldn't be that broken up if we didn't, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.32,0:35:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.71,0:35:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.55,0:35:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.04,0:35:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面没有地狱  上面没有天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hell below us, above us only sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.26,0:35:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们的朋友都不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, our friends are back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  可这里  你有个完美的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but here, you got a pretty good life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.22,0:35:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  从你6个月大起  那个地方就\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, back home, the hits have been coming
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.64,0:35:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直没消停过\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you were 6 months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.09,0:35:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得承认  当个有钱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to admit, being a-a bazillionare,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.16,0:35:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还跟露比结了婚  一切完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}married to Ruby, the whole package.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.89,0:36:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这无可厚非\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.98,0:36:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you know, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.67,0:36:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的生活确实很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just don't mean the same thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.97,0:36:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们在这里都不是兄弟关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're not even brothers here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.66,0:36:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  那我们就开始疯狂的回家行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then. Let's get our crazy show back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  兄弟  究竟怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, dude. What the hell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.01,0:36:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-埃里克  谢谢你能来  -别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eric. Thanks for coming. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.21,0:36:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.06,0:36:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对我们来说意义很大  还可以请你帮忙  \N{\fnArial\fs30}It means a lot that we can still, you know, call on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.55,0:36:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错  米沙  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. Misha, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.52,0:36:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道  这可真是个悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know, I know. It's just awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.63,0:36:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对  绝对是悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's totally, totally awful. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.55,0:36:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可也让我们上了报纸头条   你看了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got us the front page of variety, though. Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.52,0:36:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-头条  真的吗  -没错  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Front page? Really? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.14,0:36:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是个悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.96,0:36:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是悲剧  我也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tragic. That's what I was gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.61,0:36:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的"Octocobra"如何了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's "Octocobra"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.47,0:36:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我找到了突破口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I think I really had a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.90,0:36:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午饭的时候我会跟你好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you all about it over lunch, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.96,0:36:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:36:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.18,0:37:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那我就先去他们的拖车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so I am just gonna bust in their trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好教训他俩一顿  然后再处理那些乱七...\N{\fnArial\fs30}guns blazing, and then take care of this whole mess and --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.93,0:37:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人  他就是那个临时演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy. I think that's the extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.41,0:37:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.66,0:37:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以先把他扼杀在摇篮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can nip this bud right out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.37,0:37:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  临时演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.08,0:37:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪  他手里有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun! He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.65,0:37:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.50,0:37:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天应该没有枪战的戏  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we have gunfire on the call sheet today, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.15,0:38:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.57,0:38:23.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔来了  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.42,0:38:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.31,0:38:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都这么走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}have the strangest luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肉身不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.97,0:38:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄看起来是个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude looks like a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.14,0:38:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.03,0:39:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是奥尔巴尼车站一个储物柜的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that will open you a locker at the albany bus station.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.39,0:39:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.33,0:39:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得找个合适的诱饵  不然怎么让你相信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I needed a modest decoy to make it more convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.55,0:39:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.87,0:39:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  亲爱的  它们不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, darling. They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.94,0:39:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.78,0:39:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, too bloody late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.65,0:39:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  它们藏得太隐蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, they were so well-hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.71,0:39:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我需要点时间去找它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I needed time to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.67,0:39:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就让这两个小猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I volunteered these two marmosets
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.27,0:39:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去和维吉尔玩了场抛接游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a game of fetch with Virgil.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.68,0:39:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个真是相当的好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were such an adequate stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.82,0:39:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.18,0:39:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你犯的最后一个错误了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made your last mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.05,0:39:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的招数可不仅仅如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've got a few more up my sleeve,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.11,0:39:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉斐尔  离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from him, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.36,0:39:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到了武器  现在它们的力量都属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the weapons now. Their power is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.04,0:39:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.37,0:39:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想今晚死的话  就快离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want to die tonight, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.13,0:40:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.32,0:40:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...现在你得到了武器  可千万别玩火自焚\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Now that you have your sword, try not to die by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.20,0:40:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你也有份参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you were in on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.78,0:40:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用我们来分散敌人注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}using us as a diversion?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.79,0:40:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是巴尔萨泽的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Balthazar's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.73,0:40:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.39,0:40:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  这听着可不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not comforting, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.51,0:40:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们究竟要怎样才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will I be able to make you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.79,0:40:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我输给了拉斐尔  我们就都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I lose against Raphael, we all lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.51,0:40:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都得完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.44,0:40:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  小卡   我们清楚这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Cass. We know the stakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是你竟然瞒着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about all you've told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.70,0:40:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对此我感到非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.82,0:40:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的时候我会解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain when I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.57,0:40:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的小翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friggin' angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.61,0:41:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.37,0:41:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.37,0:41:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.97,0:41:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.48,0:41:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真实的  霉味十足的  摇摇欲坠的可爱的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, real, moldy, termite-eaten home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.83,0:41:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一大堆恨不得把我们活剥的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chock full of crap that want to skin you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.72,0:41:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又成了穷鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're broke again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.12,0:41:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.67,0:41:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.05,0:41:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we're talking.
